      },
      "m_displayImage1": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Merchant_C_NPC.dds",
      "m_displayImage2": "",
      "m_clientTags": [],
      "m_genericEvents": [],
      "m_autoQualify": false,
      "m_autoComplete": false,
      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC10_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "With that kind of panache, I can get you into a spot in the Muse's personal entourage! Come here, you two.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Merchant_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Fosse_EMP_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254364,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC10_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Furious Khan routine's a bit overcooked these days, but you've got something... real stage presence. I can work that!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Merchant_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Fosse_EMP_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254364,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC10_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And the mysterious Wizard advisor is a nice touch... so kitschy! The Muse will love that. We just need to tweak your routine. Significantly.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Merchant_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Fosse_EMP_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254364,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC10_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Um, no. YOU listen, mister. If you want to gain an audience with the Muse, you're going to have to earn it! Song, dance, spectacle. Got it?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Merchant_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Fosse_EMP_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254364,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC10_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "First of all, you're going to need a REAL Khan costume. There are spare Leisure Dome Suits in the changing room. Go put one on. Now. Scoot!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Merchant_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Fosse_EMP_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254364,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC10_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "As for you, Wizard, you're obviously going to have to carry this show. There's no time to rehearse, so just use this choreography cheat sheet.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Merchant_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Fosse_EMP_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254364,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "EM-ZANA-NPC10_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "There are only two hundred unique dance steps listed, so if you burn through them too quickly, just vamp. *Gasp* You can tap, right?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Alphoi_Merchant_C_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_EMP|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Fosse_EMP_07.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1254364,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
